  "details": "Create a venndiagram of group associations that can be applied to an instance.\n\n- Allow a instance creator to assign a Instance Host Group, and maybe 2 or 3 of their other group associations.\n\n- Users associated with any group would see the instance in their social as normal.\n\nexample use cases:\n\n-boosting the visibility of public events for example: An event instance hosted by hobby/event group +  Regional Locale group + Social Group\n\n-Boost user connections between groups that are culturally compartmentalized as-in formed around a singular event or topic.\n\nI believe this would promote inter-group community building so that more user connections can be made across community gardens\n\nConsiderations: \n\n- Call it World/World+/World Public \n\n- users should probably need to filter sort/hide instances by group association\n\n- a group rank role option to allow creation of World instances\n\n- shared moderation list\n\n- group rights to deny/revoke association\n\n- World+ association notification for group moderators, (consider a 30 minute default auto-approve waiting period before the server is ready for review?)\n\n*edited considerations and formatting",
